  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can form a telepathic connection between your mind and another's. As a Bonus Action, choose one creature you can see within 30 feet of you. You and that creature can communicate telepathically while within a number of miles of each other equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of 1 mile); to understand each other, you each must mentally use a language the other knows. The connection lasts for a number of minutes equal to your Warlock level, and it ends early if you use this feature to connect with a different creature.</p>",
